WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.875
<b>In the description of the previous verse,</b>

2
00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:37.291
<b>'Buddhi Yoga' and 'Nishkama Karma Yoga' </b>
<b>these two terms were used.</b>

3
00:00:37.291 --> 00:00:42.916
<b>It is essential to know that whether it is </b>
<b>'Buddhi Yoga' or 'Nishkama Karma Yoga',</b>

4
00:00:42.916 --> 00:00:46.083
<b>both carry the same meaning.</b>

5
00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:51.375
<b>In this verse, Lord Krishna is now explaining </b>
<b>the benefits of 'Nishkama Karma Yoga'.</b>

6
00:00:51.375 --> 00:00:52.541
<b>He says,</b>

7
00:00:52.541 --> 00:00:57.208
<b>in this 'Nishkama Karma Yoga', </b>
<b>no effort goes to waste,</b>

8
00:00:57.208 --> 00:01:00.166
<b>it has no negative consequences.</b>

9
00:01:00.166 --> 00:01:08.375
<b>And even a small practice in the direction </b>
<b>of this yoga is capable of freeing one from fear.</b>

10
00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:14.708
<b>'Yoga',</b>

11
00:01:14.708 --> 00:01:17.958
<b>first know about this word.</b>

12
00:01:17.958 --> 00:01:21.625
<b>This word comes from the Sanskrit word 'yuj'</b>

13
00:01:21.625 --> 00:01:24.500
<b>which means 'to join'.</b>

14
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:31.791
<b>In this context, yoga means that practice </b>
<b>which joins the living being with the Divine.</b>

15
00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:32.875
<b>Many people</b>

16
00:01:32.875 --> 00:01:36.750
<b>understand yoga as merely a physical activity,</b>

17
00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:38.458
<b>but it's not so.</b>

18
00:01:38.458 --> 00:01:39.666
<b>Karma Yoga,</b>

19
00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:41.000
<b>Bhakti Yoga,</b>

20
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.208
<b>Gyana Yoga,</b>

21
00:01:42.208 --> 00:01:43.916
<b>Dhyana Yoga etc.,</b>

22
00:01:43.916 --> 00:01:46.625
<b>these are all different types of yoga.</b>

23
00:01:46.625 --> 00:01:48.583
<b>Some are physical activities,</b>

24
00:01:48.583 --> 00:01:52.791
<b>while some are related to</b>
<b>meditation, devotion, and knowledge.</b>

25
00:01:52.791 --> 00:01:55.416
<b>To understand it in the simplest form</b>

26
00:01:55.416 --> 00:02:00.791
<b>any activity that a person performs</b>
<b>with awareness of their spiritual form,</b>

27
00:02:00.791 --> 00:02:03.291
<b>and does to connect with the Divine,</b>

28
00:02:03.291 --> 00:02:04.875
<b>is yoga.</b>

29
00:02:04.875 --> 00:02:08.583
<b>Now let's understand the context of this verse.</b>

30
00:02:08.583 --> 00:02:10.791
<b>Arjuna is on the battlefield,</b>

31
00:02:10.791 --> 00:02:13.333
<b>and in such a situation when yoga is mentioned,</b>

32
00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:16.583
<b>perhaps doubt may arise in his mind,</b>

33
00:02:16.583 --> 00:02:20.791
<b>that where is the time to </b>
<b>practice yoga in such circumstances?</b>

34
00:02:20.791 --> 00:02:22.875
<b>And even if yoga is practiced,</b>

35
00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:24.791
<b>mistakes could happen.</b>

36
00:02:24.791 --> 00:02:28.250
<b>Perhaps knowing these very doubts of Arjuna,</b>

37
00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:30.000
<b>Lord Krishna explains</b>

38
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.666
<b>that in the process of Nishkama Karma Yoga,</b>

39
00:02:32.666 --> 00:02:35.500
<b>no practice goes waste,</b>

40
00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:39.125
<b>not even if practice remains incomplete,</b>

41
00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:41.875
<b>not even if mistakes happen.</b>

42
00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:45.083
<b>No kind of practice is futile.</b>

43
00:02:45.083 --> 00:02:47.583
<b>Here Krishna also clarifies</b>

44
00:02:47.583 --> 00:02:51.750
<b>that even a small practice in the direction</b>
<b>of Nishkama Karma Yoga</b>

45
00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:55.333
<b>is capable of freeing one from fear.</b>

46
00:02:55.333 --> 00:03:03.500
<b>Moreover, this yoga has the capacity to </b>
<b>remove the greatest fear of the human soul.</b>

47
00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.541
<b>What is this greatest fear?</b>

48
00:03:05.541 --> 00:03:08.291
<b>This fear is that after death,</b>

49
00:03:08.291 --> 00:03:12.000
<b>in the next birth, that soul will fall </b>
<b>from human category,</b>

50
00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:17.333
<b>and will have to take the body </b>
<b>of such a lower category being</b>

51
00:03:17.333 --> 00:03:23.416
<b>where no facility of human life </b>
<b>will be available to it.</b>

52
00:03:28.125 --> 00:03:33.250
<b>The world can be perceived in two distinct ways:</b>

53
00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.291
<b>First</b>

54
00:03:34.291 --> 00:03:36.041
<b>The Material Perspective</b>

55
00:03:36.041 --> 00:03:41.875
<b>This view holds that everything in</b>
<b>the world is purely physical,</b>

56
00:03:41.875 --> 00:03:46.291
<b>and material pleasures are life's sole purpose</b>

57
00:03:46.291 --> 00:03:47.750
<b>Second is</b>

58
00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:50.625
<b>the Spiritual Perspective</b>

59
00:03:50.625 --> 00:03:54.583
<b>This view understands the nature of the soul,</b>

60
00:03:54.583 --> 00:04:00.583
<b>and accepts the truth that </b>
<b>every being houses a soul,</b>

61
00:04:00.583 --> 00:04:07.458
<b>and the evolution and elevation of </b>
<b>this soul is life's ultimate purpose.</b>

62
00:04:07.458 --> 00:04:12.083
<b>If you view life through the </b>
<b>short-sighted lens of materialism,</b>

63
00:04:12.083 --> 00:04:20.166
<b>then all consequences of your actions</b>
<b>in this life end with death.</b>

64
00:04:20.166 --> 00:04:21.666
<b>However,</b>

65
00:04:21.666 --> 00:04:26.458
<b>if you view it through the</b>
<b>far-reaching lens of spirituality,</b>

66
00:04:26.458 --> 00:04:34.291
<b>you'll understand that any action </b>
<b>you've taken for the soul's elevation</b>

67
00:04:34.291 --> 00:04:38.416
<b>remains unaffected by death,</b>

68
00:04:38.416 --> 00:04:43.750
<b>for death merely destroys the physical body.</b>

69
00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:46.625
<b>The soul is immortal,</b>

70
00:04:46.625 --> 00:04:54.541
<b>and the spiritual growth achieved in this bodily </b>
<b>life will not go in vain, will not be nullified.</b>

71
00:04:54.541 --> 00:04:55.833
<b>In the next life,</b>

72
00:04:55.833 --> 00:04:59.375
<b>the soul's journey begins exactly</b>

73
00:04:59.375 --> 00:05:02.583
<b>where it left off in the previous birth.</b>

74
00:05:02.583 --> 00:05:05.125
<b>Consider this</b>

75
00:05:05.125 --> 00:05:11.916
<b>birth after birth, the soul's level </b>
<b>only rises, never diminishes.</b>

76
00:05:11.916 --> 00:05:14.333
<b>In this life, whether small or large,</b>

77
00:05:14.333 --> 00:05:20.833
<b>any step taken towards the soul's</b>
<b>elevation will not be futile.</b>

78
00:05:20.833 --> 00:05:26.375
<b>And this isn't a time-bound</b>
<b>process either; it is eternal.</b>

79
00:05:26.375 --> 00:05:31.291
<b>Where it pauses today, it will resume</b>
<b>from there in the next life.</b>

80
00:05:31.291 --> 00:05:34.791
<b>How liberating is this thought!</b>

81
00:05:34.791 --> 00:05:39.250
<b>There is simply no room for</b>
<b>fear in this understanding.</b>

82
00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:40.291
<b>And in such circumstances,</b>

83
00:05:40.291 --> 00:05:44.791
<b>a narrow-minded person makes one mistake</b>

84
00:05:44.791 --> 00:05:47.875
<b>when given more time,</b>

85
00:05:47.875 --> 00:05:51.000
<b>they become lazy, slow down,</b>

86
00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.791
<b>and soon become deluded,</b>

87
00:05:53.791 --> 00:05:56.333
<b>forgetting their purpose.</b>

88
00:05:56.333 --> 00:05:57.916
<b>And when they finally awaken,</b>

89
00:05:57.916 --> 00:06:04.458
<b>they live in fear and regret that </b>
<b>too much time has passed.</b>

90
00:06:04.458 --> 00:06:06.541
<b>Don't make this mistake</b>

91
00:06:06.541 --> 00:06:11.750
<b>invest time in your spiritual </b>
<b>elevation during this life.</b>

92
00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:18.583
<b>Think of it as an investment </b>
<b>you're making in your own future.</b>

93
00:06:22.916 --> 00:06:26.500
<b>Everyone wants to secure their future.</b>

94
00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:29.500
<b>They make plans for it,</b>

95
00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:36.375
<b>whether for themselves or</b>
<b>for their family and children.</b>

96
00:06:36.375 --> 00:06:37.916
<b>But</b>

97
00:06:37.916 --> 00:06:44.708
<b>are your future plans limited only to this lifetime?</b>

98
00:06:44.708 --> 00:06:47.333
<b>And after death?</b>

99
00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:50.041
<b>What about the next life?</b>

100
00:06:50.041 --> 00:06:55.458
<b>Can you do something today for that as well?</b>

101
00:06:55.458 --> 00:06:57.625
<b>Certainly you can</b>

102
00:06:57.625 --> 00:07:04.541
<b>when you invest your time and </b>
<b>efforts in spiritual elevation</b>

103
00:07:04.541 --> 00:07:12.583
<b>its benefits will reach you not just in this birth, </b>
<b>but in every life to come.</b>

104
00:07:12.583 --> 00:07:18.916
<b>That's why when you make future </b>
<b>plans for your family and children,</b>

105
00:07:18.916 --> 00:07:24.875
<b>ensure you consider their </b>
<b>spiritual progress as well.</b>

106
00:07:24.875 --> 00:07:31.791
<b>Investing time in spirituality</b>
<b>is crucial for everyone.</b>

107
00:07:31.791 --> 00:07:35.708
<b>Now perhaps you'll say</b>

108
00:07:35.708 --> 00:07:42.083
<b>when your children or family show no</b>
<b>interest in the spiritual perspective,</b>

109
00:07:42.083 --> 00:07:47.375
<b>why spend time on such pursuits?</b>

110
00:07:47.375 --> 00:07:51.041
<b>Time spent would be wasted,</b>

111
00:07:51.041 --> 00:07:52.041
<b>because</b>

112
00:07:52.041 --> 00:07:54.083
<b>due to their disinterest,</b>

113
00:07:54.083 --> 00:07:58.916
<b>the work will surely remain incomplete.</b>

114
00:07:58.916 --> 00:08:01.375
<b>So what's the benefit?</b>

115
00:08:01.375 --> 00:08:03.208
<b>True indeed,</b>

116
00:08:03.208 --> 00:08:07.375
<b>but this is precisely where</b>
<b>understanding is needed</b>

117
00:08:07.375 --> 00:08:13.541
<b>that even half a step taken towards</b>
<b>spirituality never goes waste.</b>

118
00:08:13.541 --> 00:08:16.125
<b>Half, incomplete, small, or large</b>

119
00:08:16.125 --> 00:08:21.125
<b>any spiritual gain keeps accumulating.</b>

120
00:08:21.125 --> 00:08:23.875
<b>Wherever you reach in this life,</b>

121
00:08:23.875 --> 00:08:27.625
<b>the next life's journey will begin from there.</b>

122
00:08:27.625 --> 00:08:30.875
<b>So how can anything be wasted?</b>

123
00:08:30.875 --> 00:08:35.541
<b>If you halt somewhere at </b>
<b>night during a long journey,</b>

124
00:08:35.541 --> 00:08:37.416
<b>when you open your eyes in the morning,</b>

125
00:08:37.416 --> 00:08:43.916
<b>you don't find yourself back at </b>
<b>yesterday's starting point, do you?</b>

126
00:08:43.916 --> 00:08:47.375
<b>The journey doesn't reset to zero.</b>

127
00:08:47.375 --> 00:08:52.541
<b>You continue from where </b>
<b>you stopped for the night.</b>

128
00:08:52.541 --> 00:08:57.000
<b>This is exactly like that.</b>

129
00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:02.416
<b>Don't worry about things </b>
<b>remaining incomplete or unfinished.</b>

130
00:09:02.416 --> 00:09:05.583
<b>Simply encourage your family</b>

131
00:09:05.583 --> 00:09:14.000
<b>to spend whatever time they can</b>
<b>in spiritual knowledge, wherever they are.</b>

132
00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:18.000
<b>Just show your family the direction of spirituality,</b>

133
00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:20.583
<b>don't worry about their pace.</b>

134
00:09:20.583 --> 00:09:26.291
<b>In this path, even their</b>
<b>mere beginning is a big step.</b>

135
00:09:26.291 --> 00:09:31.875
<b>And for their further guidance, </b>
<b>to hold their hand,</b>

136
00:09:31.875 --> 00:09:34.625
<b>I am always here.</b>

137
00:09:34.625 --> 00:09:36.750
<b>Your Krishna.</b>

138
00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:43.166
<b>In professional life,</b>

139
00:09:43.166 --> 00:09:47.958
<b>what kinds of fears can trouble a person?</b>

140
00:09:47.958 --> 00:09:48.916
<b>Perhaps</b>

141
00:09:48.916 --> 00:09:53.041
<b>the fear of being dismissed from work,</b>

142
00:09:53.041 --> 00:09:56.125
<b>Fear of heavy financial loss,</b>

143
00:09:56.125 --> 00:10:00.208
<b>Fear of losing one's high reputation,</b>

144
00:10:00.208 --> 00:10:03.708
<b>Or something else.</b>

145
00:10:03.708 --> 00:10:09.541
<b>Now suppose you had to</b>
<b>tell which of these two people</b>

146
00:10:09.541 --> 00:10:14.708
<b>would live with more fear in </b>
<b>their professional life.</b>

147
00:10:14.708 --> 00:10:16.250
<b>First person</b>

148
00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:19.291
<b>whose perspective is filled with desires.</b>

149
00:10:19.291 --> 00:10:21.125
<b>They think only about</b>

150
00:10:21.125 --> 00:10:25.375
<b>how to acquire more and more for themselves</b>

151
00:10:25.375 --> 00:10:26.500
<b>more wealth,</b>

152
00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:27.875
<b>more profit,</b>

153
00:10:27.875 --> 00:10:30.625
<b>more prestige.</b>

154
00:10:30.625 --> 00:10:32.541
<b>Second person</b>

155
00:10:32.541 --> 00:10:39.375
<b>in whose perspective their work </b>
<b>and responsibility are most important.</b>

156
00:10:39.375 --> 00:10:43.875
<b>They don't work with desire </b>
<b>for any particular outcome,</b>

157
00:10:43.875 --> 00:10:44.708
<b>because</b>

158
00:10:44.708 --> 00:10:47.416
<b>they firmly believe that</b>

159
00:10:47.416 --> 00:10:52.416
<b>their control is only over their work,</b>

160
00:10:52.416 --> 00:10:55.458
<b>and this alone will increase their capability,</b>

161
00:10:55.458 --> 00:10:58.458
<b>and if they keep doing good work,</b>

162
00:10:58.458 --> 00:11:03.750
<b>favorable results will come sooner or later.</b>

163
00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:05.208
<b>So tell me? </b>

164
00:11:05.208 --> 00:11:10.958
<b>Who among these would </b>
<b>be more troubled by fear?</b>

165
00:11:10.958 --> 00:11:14.458
<b>The answer is crystal clear</b>

166
00:11:14.458 --> 00:11:15.625
<b>the first person</b>

167
00:11:15.625 --> 00:11:17.916
<b>will always live in fear,</b>

168
00:11:17.916 --> 00:11:18.875
<b>because</b>

169
00:11:18.875 --> 00:11:24.083
<b>one eye is always fixed on </b>
<b>wealth, profit, and prestige,</b>

170
00:11:24.083 --> 00:11:30.583
<b>so the fear of losing these is natural.</b>

171
00:11:30.583 --> 00:11:31.708
<b>Meanwhile,</b>

172
00:11:31.708 --> 00:11:34.791
<b>the second person is fearless,</b>

173
00:11:34.791 --> 00:11:36.708
<b>because they know that</b>

174
00:11:36.708 --> 00:11:42.250
<b>if their work is good, results </b>
<b>will come on their own.</b>

175
00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:45.166
<b>They are carefree and liberated.</b>

176
00:11:45.166 --> 00:11:50.041
<b>In a way, this is the yoga of selfless action.</b>

177
00:11:50.041 --> 00:11:54.291
<b>Where work alone is supreme.</b>

178
00:11:54.291 --> 00:11:58.750
<b>Which person would you prefer to become? </b>

179
00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:01.791
<b>Tell me?</b>

180
00:12:01.791 --> 00:12:03.791
<b>Don't live in fear,</b>

181
00:12:03.791 --> 00:12:05.291
<b>become liberated,</b>

182
00:12:05.291 --> 00:12:09.125
<b>choose the path of selfless action.</b>

